Package: reservekit
Title: Transparent and Validated General Insurance Loss Reserving
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Kks", "", email = "ikshrestha220@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for general insurance (property and casualty) loss
    reserving: development triangles that distinguish cumulative from
    incremental data and structural from genuine missing values, data
    validation, chain ladder, Bornhuetter-Ferguson, Cape Cod and expected
    loss ratio methods, tail factors, Mack (1993) <doi:10.2143/AST.23.2.2005092>
    prediction errors and Mack's diagnostic tests. All methods share one
    result object; formulas are documented and results are tested against
    published examples, exact reference calculations and an independent
    implementation.
